  "metadata": {
    "id": "ridge_camp",
    "name": "Ridge Camp",
    "author": "ChronoSplit",
    "description": "A stone keep round an open courtyard, four storeys of fighting: a sunken pit with the rocket launcher, the courtyard and its cloister, a U of railed ledges reached by stairs and a long ramp, and a high deck over the north colonnade that only the jump pad reaches, holding the railgun. An homage in spirit to the great multi-level stone arenas.",
